# Pairs with LinkGateMatchesLinking. A gate held past its link wedges every later capture link.
MODULE: ReturnKeepsGate
TARGET: LinkGateMatchesLinking
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the link returns without releasing the root's link gate
PERTURBS: ReturnLink

--- FIND
    /\ linked' = TRUE
    /\ linkGate' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ linked' = TRUE
    \* MUTATION: the link gate is kept
    /\ linkGate' = linkGate
--- END
